Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:19:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: DumpPage container and DumpPageContext replace
 DumpScreen

The route reads its two actions through the toDumpPageProps adapter in src/utils/dump.ts and renders DumpPage, which owns the feed and provides capture, captureError and loadMore through DumpPageContext; DumpComposer and DumpFeed read them from it instead of callback props. The Dump scenarios render DumpPage through the same adapter over raw fixtures.

